t (spawn count, wall clock, or peak concurrent children) recorded in the completion event; (4) full regression suite green after the change (in-flight runs are not passed). REFERENCE: task-router tests/conftest.py (shared_seed_registry/seed_registry_copy) and tests/test_circuit_hardening.py are the worked examples to copy from.", "ts": "2026-09-19T20:15:17Z"}
