up looks right'.", "created_at": "2026-09-20T04:49:43Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T06:09:16Z", "worker_status": "pending", "detail": {"fingerprint": "4228fc623fb8fe5307fcbf9994be8de9a1cdede7bacac58b4a6a7db6a1ab98d0"}, "ts": null, "complexity": 3, "foreman_note": "multipart E2E dispatch after DF-2 merge cleared serve.go", "worktree": "/home/kara/worktrees/coding-hermes-boardctl-DF-BOARDCTL-6", "branch": "wt/DF-BOARDCTL-6"}
 {"id": "DF-BOARDCTL-7", "title": "Usage errors print a literal backslash-n into the message, and subcommand usage output collides with its own exit line on one line", "status": "complete", "priority": "P2", "reasoning": "MEASURED 2026-09-20 (dogfood run, discovered while correcting a row title).\nREPRO: boardctl update DF-BOARDCTL-6 --title x   (any flag the subcommand does not define)\nEVIDENCE (cat -A, so the escapes are visible):\n  flag provided but not defined: -title$\n  boardctl update <id> [--status complete] [--worktree PATH] ... [-C dir]\\nboardctl: flag provided but not defined: -title$\nThe usage string contains an escaped '\\n' that was never interpreted as a newline, so the usage text and the following error line are printed run-together on ONE physical line, and the user literally sees the characters backslash-n in the middle of the message. Expected: the usage text on its own line(s), then the error line (or the error first, then usage).\nIMPACT: small but it degrades every usage error in the CLI - the first thing a user sees when they mistype a flag is mojibake-ish output that makes the tool look unpolished, and the run-together line makes the real error harder to spot in a terminal.\nALSO MEASURED (not filed separately): 'boardctl <cmd> --help' exits 1 for every subcommand while bare 'help'/'--help' exits 0. docs/dogfood/diagnostics.md records this as deliberate, so it is only mentioned here for context.\nFIX DIRECTION: emit the usage block with a real newline (or two separate writes) and keep the error line separate.", "created_at": "2026-09-20T04:52:22Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-20T05:36:45Z", "worker_status": "pending", "detail": {"fingerprint": "4266a31cbf0345ff522fb898891e1ba4c135ae8ca526b0a4e385063e8d78cfd3"}, "ts": null, "complexity": 3, "foreman_note": "wave dispatch tick boardctl-2026-09-20-04-54-08", "worktree": "/home/kara/worktrees/coding-hermes-boardctl-DF-BOARDCTL-7", "branch": "wt/DF-BOARDCTL-7", "commit_hash": "ac5442e", "guard_result": "PASS", "ci_result": "GREEN", "worker_summary": "literal backslash-n fixed in 2 usage closures, 20-subtest output table; merged+pushed, verdict c1d71e7a", "sessions": ["20260920_001314_4e0e27"]}
